== Usage ==
* Grab a 7 hero team.
* Clear the chamber and [[gww:Bladed Aatxe|Aatxes]].
* Take the [[gww:Lost Soul (Underworld)|Lost Soul]]'s quest.
* Aggro all enemies, let heroes come after bodyblock.
* Clear the west passage of enemies and flag heroes back.
* Run to the [[gww:Obsidian Behemoth|Behemoths]].
* If it's not blocked, run past it and use a cupcake or candy for running. If it is blocked, use your heroes to clear the Behemoths.
* Run to the plains.
* Dodge the [[gww:Charged Blackness|Charged Blackness]].
* At plains, kill the first group. You must use [[gww:Signet of Mystic Speed|Signet of Mystic Speed]] every time for Shadow Form and Shroud of Distress.
* Aggro the Mindblades. Bodyblock them against the wall on your right. (See the video)
* Kill them and rinse and repeat the usage.
* Avoid Skeletons of Dhuum whenever possible.

== Counters ==
* Forgetting [[gww:Signet_of_Mystic_Speed|SoMS]]
* Lagging out
* Too much aggro without [[gww:Critical_Agility|Critical Agility]]
* Not keeping up SF due to [[gww:Energy|energy problems]] or [[gww:Latency|lag]]

